<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns seven auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns seven auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has assigned all seven auctions whereby it sought to drain 5.442 billion pesos in the secondary market on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    800 million    56 days   22.55 pct</p>
<p>    800 million    45 days   22.50 pct</p>
<p>    900 million    34 days   22.27 pct</p>
<p>    900 million    28 days   21.75 pct</p>
<p>    900 million    27 days   21.40 pct</p>
<p>    950 million    23 days   20.80 pct</p>
<p>    192 million     1 day    19.28 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
